and. Since I can play the pair as a valid move, this guarantees an immediate victory.\n\nReason:\nI have a pair of Aces and only two cards in my hand. It is a Free Play turn. Playing the pair allows me to play all my cards at once and win the game immediately. There is no strategic benefit to holding back.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠A", "♣A"]}'}
